{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relatable Workplace Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ordinary packaging shift turns tense when a boundary-crossing co-worker keeps testing how far you\u2019ll bend.</p></li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anti-Dating Sim // Choices Matter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every yes, <strong>NO</strong>, or awkward silence shifts the relationships and power balance.</p></li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your approach unlocks several possible outcomes, from a strained farewell to a chilling finale.</p></li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror, No Cheap Jumpscares</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear comes from silence, hostile stares, and the feeling of being cornered.</p></li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Based on True Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah, this shit really happened to me, and living through it was awkward as hell.</p></li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short but Unsettling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-hour playthroughs make it easy to experiment with different boundaries and endings.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706160?t=1761576333","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706160/d0baf7e4693c2ce7182f259b3faa9c1b49789ff3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761576333","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706160/3ec16ed8f74114187a91bb1091c65eeaccb721dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761576333","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.stea